# Implementation Plan - SHROOOMS UI/UX & Functional Enhancements

This plan outlines the technical changes to implement the owner's UI/UX feedback while preserving the existing SHROOOMS visual identity, catalog products, backend integrations, cart system, and responsive layout.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **No Breaking Changes**: All existing functionality (Redux store, cart logic, Razorpay/Firebase API calls, routing, existing pages) will be strictly preserved.
> 
> **Category Normalization**: We will normalize product categories across `mockAPI.js`, `productsListAction.js`, and `Shop/ProductsPage.js` to ensure 100% strict matching for the required categories:
> - **Sponges**
> - **Accessories**
> - **Liquid Culture**
> - **Fresh Mushrooms**
> - **Dried Mushrooms**
> - **Spawn**
> - **Tools & Accessories**
> - **All**

