## Proposed Changes

### 1. Global Loading & Initial Page Render System

#### [NEW] [GlobalLoader.js](file:///u:/VeggiesShop-main/src/components/GlobalLoader/GlobalLoader.js)
#### [NEW] [GlobalLoader.css](file:///u:/VeggiesShop-main/src/components/GlobalLoader/GlobalLoader.css)
- Implement a branded full-screen loader featuring the SHROOOMS spore emblem, gold/emerald glow orbs, and pulse animation.
- Preload critical images (Hero assets, brand logos, top cultivar images) using `Image()` preload promises and `document.readyState` check.
- Keep main application UI hidden with CSS until asset readiness is confirmed to prevent section-by-section pop-in.
- Include safety cap timeout fallback (max 3.5s) to guarantee rendering even on slow network responses or broken image URLs.
- Include `prefers-reduced-motion` check to bypass complex spin animations for accessibility.
- Do NOT display loader on internal category changes or minor user clicks.

#### [MODIFY] [App.js](file:///u:/VeggiesShop-main/src/App.js)
- Wrap root application in `GlobalLoader` wrapper to manage initial mount lifecycle.

