### 3. Strict Product Category Filtering

#### [MODIFY] [mockAPI.js](file:///u:/VeggiesShop-main/src/mockAPI.js)
#### [MODIFY] [productsListAction.js](file:///u:/VeggiesShop-main/src/store/actions/actionCreators/productsListAction.js)
#### [MODIFY] [ProductsPage.js](file:///u:/VeggiesShop-main/src/pages/Shop/ProductsPage.js)
- Normalize and assign canonical categories to all catalog products:
  - `Sponges` (e.g. Mushroom Sponges, Cleaning & Substrate Sponges)
  - `Accessories` (e.g. Spray Misters, Temperature Monitors,Scalpels)
  - `Liquid Culture` (e.g. Lion's Mane LC, Blue Oyster LC, Reishi LC Syringes)
  - `Fresh Mushrooms` (e.g. Fresh Lion's Mane, Fresh King Oyster, Fresh Pink Oyster)
  - `Dried Mushrooms` (e.g. Dried Shiitake, Dried Reishi Slices, Dried Cordyceps)
  - `Spawn` (e.g. Blue Oyster Grain Spawn, Pink Oyster Grain Spawn, Shiitake Spawn)
  - `Tools & Accessories` (e.g. Inoculation Tools, HEPA Filters, Autoclavable PP Bags)
- Update filter logic to perform **strict exact equality checks** (`product.category === selectedCategory`) rather than loose string includes.
- Support URL query parameter (`?category=sponges`, `?category=liquid-culture`, etc.) to persist category selection across page refreshes.
- Provide a smooth empty-state view when a category has zero matching products.

#### [MODIFY] [CategoryGrid.js](file:///u:/VeggiesShop-main/src/components/CategoryGrid/CategoryGrid.js)
- Render all 8 canonical category chips/cards with icons and descriptions.
- Synchronize category clicks with Redux and URL state.

