## Verification Plan

### Automated & Static Verification
- Run `npm test` or React build verification (`npm run build`) to ensure zero TypeScript/JS compile errors.

### Manual Visual & Functional QA
1. **Initial Load**: Refresh page with cleared cache; verify full-screen branded SHROOOMS loader appears without layout jumps or raw pop-in.
2. **Category Filtering**: Click each of the 8 category filters (**Sponges**, **Accessories**, **Liquid Culture**, **Fresh Mushrooms**, **Dried Mushrooms**, **Spawn**, **Tools & Accessories**, **All**). Verify ONLY items belonging to that category are shown.
3. **URL Refresh**: Select `Liquid Culture`, copy URL, refresh page; verify `Liquid Culture` remains selected.
4. **Below-The-Fold**: Verify organic rounded visual containers and carousels on desktop (1440px), tablet (768px), and mobile (390px).
5. **Info Modal**: Click "i" icon on items; verify `InfoModal` opens cleanly, locks background scroll, closes with Escape key or backdrop click.
6. **Cart LED Marquee**: Open Cart drawer; verify smooth 60fps continuous horizontal marquee without horizontal scrollbars or visual jumps. Test adding cross-sell item to cart directly from marquee.
7. **Promotional & Info Popups**: Test promotional modal styling vs informational modal styling.
